        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;&#39; -------------------- 9. SYSTEM SEQUENCE (SSD): UC-04 --------------------\n@startuml Sada_Sequence_UC04\ntitle UC-04 — Review Suspicious Case (System Sequence Diagram)\nautonumber\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam sequence {\n  ActorBorderColor #334155\n  ParticipantBorderColor #334155\n  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC\n  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B\n  ArrowColor #334155\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Review Employee\&quot; as Reviewer\nparticipant \&quot;Sada Platform\&quot; as System\n\nReviewer -&gt; System: openReviewQueue()\nSystem --&gt; Reviewer: displayOpenCases(caseList)\n\nReviewer -&gt; System: selectCase(caseId)\nSystem -&gt; System: authenticateReviewer(), claimCase(status=\&quot;IN_REVIEW\&quot;),\\nloadLinkedEvidence()\nSystem --&gt; Reviewer: displayCaseDetails(customer, requestOrTransfer,\\nriskIndicators, audioAssessment)\n\nopt Retained audio recording is available\n  Reviewer -&gt; System: requestRetainedRecording(caseId)\n  System --&gt; Reviewer: streamAudioRecording()\nend\n\nReviewer -&gt; System: submitReviewDecision(caseId, decision, rationale)\nSystem -&gt; System: validateDecisionAndRationale()\n\nalt Decision == ACCEPT\n  System -&gt; System: markCaseAccepted(),\\npostHeldTransferOrApproveRequest()\nelse Decision == REJECT\n  System -&gt; System: markCaseRejected(),\\ncancelHeldTransferAndUnfreezeOrRejectRequest()\nend\n\nSystem -&gt; System: appendImmutableAuditEvent(),\\napplyRetentionDeletionPolicy(), notifyCustomer()\nSystem --&gt; Reviewer: confirmDecisionRecorded(caseId, finalStatus)\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="TgTziPrXvUSxa3XX-cSn-1">
